  "declared_at": "2026-11-19",
  "purpose": "Candidate public repos for Rework Risk example reports. Kept apart from the corpus manifests, so corpus and example repos never mix. A repo is eligible only if the probe (scripts/example-reports/probe.mjs) passes every threshold below and the repo is in none of the corpus manifests listed in exclude_corpus_manifests. Every change to candidates or thresholds is recorded in changes.",
