      "reason": "The scanner finds a PR on the main line only by the PR number in the subject of the commit that landed it. zephyrproject-rtos/zephyr rebase-merges: the probe mapped every commit to a PR through GitHub, but the scan found 0 PRs. The new metric is the share of sampled PRs into the default branch whose landing commit carries their number: zephyr 0, duckdb 0.81, n8n 0.54, vllm 0.68, uv 0.85, nextcloud 1.0. n8n and vllm scanned the full 500 PRs, so the floor only catches near-zero visibility. Applies to probes from this version on."
